# The build-context filter for deploy/images/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` beside the Dockerfile in preference to a `.dockerignore` at the context
# root (the context is the repository root, the Dockerfile lives in deploy/images/). A plain `.dockerignore` placed
# here, beside the Dockerfile, would be silently ignored, and the whole repository would be sent to the builder.
# Verify with the `context` target; see deploy/README.md.

# Build output and caches: the image builds its own jar.
**/build
**/.gradle
**/.kotlin
**/out
**/*.class
**/*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Frontend and everything else the JVM build does not need.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pnpm-store
apps/web
apps/admin-web
docs
infra
tasks
deploy
.github
.git
.gitignore
*.md

# Anything that could carry a secret or a local setting.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.yaml
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfstate*
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude
compose.yaml

# Editors and operating system.
.idea
.vscode
**/*.iml
.DS_Store
